  "_comment": "Third-party skills copied into this plugin at a pinned commit. scripts/vendor_sync.py checks and updates them; never edit these folders by hand. Matt Pocock's skills are vendored one entry per skill; his setup skill is left out because it writes configuration into the repository, and only its templates are kept (shared/vendor/pocock-setup) for the SessionStart adapter. Entries with model_invocable or triggers get those frontmatter changes re-applied after every update (scripts/vendor_sync.py), so every step of the cycle can start from plain language; the skill bodies stay exactly as upstream wrote them.",
